  "details": "I am being so real right now that I cannot take these off.\n\nI clicked the button to remove it and it claimed it was removed but it was not.\n\nIt's literally bugged I could not take them off. 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭\n\nI would also like to just generally give the feedback that the user interface for the accessories was a little bit confusing primarily the editor but otherwise I think it's OK.\n\nEdit: I would like to clarify: It appears that in the accessories menu if I were to click or double click on an accessory it will mention that the accessory was attached or removed. However, i'm realizing that the intent of this prompt was not to say that it was actually attached to my real avatar but to say that it was attached to the preview of my avatar in the accessories menu. It is only when I actually press the edit button on my avatar, then click on the googly eyes, then on the save and apply button, only then it will actually apply to my avatar.\n\nThis was very confusing of a user experience. I would hope to see that prompt updated in some way to further clarify that it was only for the preview and not for your actual avatar. Thank you.",
